WEBVTT

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:14.700
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> So, tell me, what did you dream about?

00:00:16.195 --> 00:00:17.340
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> I was at a party.

00:00:18.294 --> 00:00:20.827
The room was full of people.

00:00:21.519 --> 00:00:22.344
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> What were they doing?

00:00:23.097 --> 00:00:25.974
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> They were drinking and talking.

00:00:26.334 --> 00:00:27.246
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Were you drinking?

00:00:27.654 --> 00:00:31.500
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> Yes, I was drinking champagne.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:33.980
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> And then what happened?

00:00:34.841 --> 00:00:38.020
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> Then, suddenly I was in a garden.

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:40.980
There were a lot of flowers.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:45.340
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Flowers, yes… what kind of flowers?

00:00:46.382 --> 00:00:49.740
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> I couldn’t see – it was a bit dark.

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:55.260
And I could hear music – somebody was playing the violin.

00:00:55.448 --> 00:00:56.740
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> The violin?

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:01.580
Go on.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:03.972
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> And then I saw an owl,

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:09.350
a big owl in a tree…

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:12.100
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> How did you feel?

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:14.420
Were you frightened of it?

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:22.300
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> No, not frightened really, no, but I remember I felt incredibly cold.

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:25.060
Especially my feet – they were freezing.

00:01:27.849 --> 00:01:28.729
And then I woke up.

00:01:28.926 --> 00:01:29.896
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Your feet?

00:01:30.819 --> 00:01:36.180
Mmm, very interesting, very interesting.

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:40.003
Were you wearing any shoes?

00:01:40.289 --> 00:01:42.580
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> No, no, I wasn’t.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:46.494
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Tell me, have you ever had this dream before?

00:01:46.687 --> 00:01:48.199
<v><b>Patient:</b></v> No, never.

00:01:49.129 --> 00:01:52.100
So, what does it mean, Doctor?